0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSBut4Zxibo1Vo0snHWqETpz823ib4CWgnA2sE9XlJzWwxItQXicyX0EsleO9Nl07sybN0PQjWhYS1A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RJYXTNibArSS4XoDouoeDYq8ROFk5LiaYP87ictL0B6jjkvVr8quBVPAAFMcqzwYClLr0icAlxD4p9JQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 847px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RJYXTNibArSS4XoDouoeDYqhC7qoVdJjtvqncruYbIaiaY7422TFYIibCLgzMIHNLDtyjibwqH5YdWGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 648px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n            关于\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n           希望庄园（Café Granja La Esperanza）\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          布兰卡· 里格加·科瑞（Blanca ligia correa）和胡安·安东尼奥·海瑞拉（juan antonio herrera）结婚，养育了14个孩子。这对夫妇后来被分配到波斯特西农场（postosi farm）工作，在此定居下来。1945年，除种植铁皮卡（Typica）以外，胡安·安东尼奥决定引入黄波旁（Yellow Bourbon）、红波旁（Red Bourbon）和卡杜拉（Caturra）等三个品种的咖啡。于是，1945年，希望庄园就此诞生；现在整个希望农场除了最初的几个传统品种外，还有瑰夏、希爪和庄园自己筛选和变异的品种种植；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSBut4Zxibo1Vo0snHWqETpRDVDPDMCBJTKtjD2ZBEaljMHz6QAkXyYeFwnyR6icdiaEl6fTts4ZOhg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          希望庄园旗下有5个农场，分别\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          是\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"width: 577.421875px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-indent: 0em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            Hawaii ， 位于\n            <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             Cundinamarca-\n             <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n              Sasaima\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-indent: 0em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            Potosi，位于Cauca-\n            <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             Caicedonia\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-indent: 0em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             La Esperanza\n            </span>\n            ， 位于Cauca-\n            <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             Trujillo\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-indent: 0em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             Las Margaritas，位于\n             <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n              Cauca-\n             </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n              Caicedonia\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-indent: 0em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n              Cerro Azul，\n              <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n               位于Cauca-\n              </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n               Trujillo\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;'>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amU